<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Love Quizzes</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">rhyu</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Love Quizzes</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3AnCQUv83JUHosFh9OVmLp</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.805" end="00:16.922">A - i look at you when you walk by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.922" end="00:23.289">B - i look away because i'm feelin' shy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.289" end="00:26.287">C - we're friends so i say hi</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.287" end="00:29.226">D - i've never noticed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.226" end="00:35.011">E - the sight of you makes me wanna piss my pants</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.011" end="00:39.811">A - i dream of you every night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.811" end="00:45.497">B - i've dreamt of you before but once or twice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.497" end="00:49.151">C - i manifest my dreams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.151" end="00:51.778">D - i'm sleep deprived</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.778" end="00:57.689">E - the thought of you is perpetually in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.689" end="01:03.055">Love quizzes got me in a state of mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.055" end="01:04.778">Unnecessary stressing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.778" end="01:06.278">Obsessing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.219" end="01:12.090">When the answer's clear as day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.090" end="01:14.685">And that might never change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.685" end="01:17.682">I'm in love (I'm at the top of the class)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.682" end="01:20.597">I'm in love (and I know this feeling will last）</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.597" end="01:28.597">I'm in love and the quizzes show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.855" end="01:40.680">A - my friends gave you a secret name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.680" end="01:46.129">B - they say i'm gullible for playin' your game</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.129" end="01:49.363">C - they say your flags are green</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.363" end="01:52.217">D - they think they're red</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.217" end="01:57.937">E - i don't care what they say you're perfect in every way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.937" end="02:02.803">Love quizzes got me in a state of mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.803" end="02:04.857">Unnecessary stressing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.857" end="02:06.408">Obsessing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.408" end="02:11.997">When the answer's clear as day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.997" end="02:15.080">And that might never change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.080" end="02:17.565">I'm in love (I'm at the top of the class)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.565" end="02:20.477">I'm in love (and I know this feeling will last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.477" end="02:28.477">I'm in love and the quizzes show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.309" end="02:51.501">Love quizzes got me in a state of mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.501" end="02:53.498">Unnecessary stressing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.498" end="02:55.022">Obsessing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.022" end="03:00.500">When the answer's clear as day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.500" end="03:03.245">And that might never change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.245" end="03:06.126">I'm in love (I'm at the top of the class)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.126" end="03:09.058">I'm in love (and I know this feeling will last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.058" end="03:14.866">I'm in love and the quizzes show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.866" end="03:17.831">I'm in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.831" end="03:21.831">And the quizzes know</p></div></body></tt>